# Wave-5 R-042: a spy infiltrating an enemy Battle Lab steals its tech.
# Allied player vs a Soviet AI: the spy enters the Soviet Battle Lab (NATECH,
# AIBasePlanningSide=1 -> Side1TechInfiltrated), after which the Chrono Ivan
# (CIVAN RequiresStolenSovietTech=yes, Prerequisite=BARRACKS) appears on the
# infantry tab and can be trained [RE: docs/re/abilities-w5.md §1].
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat place GAPOWR 0 building 0:GACNST +5 -3
cheat place GAPILE 0 building 0:GACNST +5 +2
wait 5
# Before: no stolen tech -> the Chrono Ivan is not buildable.
assert can_build(CIVAN) == 0 @R-042:C
assert cameo(CIVAN) == 0 @R-042:C
assert cameo(CCOMAND) == 0 @R-042:C
assert can_build(E1) == 1 @R-042:C
# The enemy Battle Lab and the spy.
cheat place NATECH 1 building 0:GACNST -10 +6
cheat spawn SPY 0 building 0:GACNST -6 +5
wait 2
click unit 0:SPY
click building 1:NATECH
until 400 units(0,SPY) == 0 @R-042:C
wait 5
assert can_build(CIVAN) == 1 @R-042:C
assert cameo(CIVAN) == 1 @R-042:C
assert cameo(CCOMAND) == 0 @R-042:C
# Train one.
click cameo:CIVAN
until 1500 units(0,CIVAN) >= 1 @R-042:C
shot stolen_tech_civan
end
